[1.731861, "o", "\u001b[1;38;5;205m  █▄▀ █ █▀▄ █ █ █ █ ▀█▀\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;141m  █ █ █ █▄▀ ▀▄▀▄▀ █  █ \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2mkidwit 0.1.0rc1 in /private/tmp/demo. /clear resets, /undo reverts the last edit, /verbose toggles detail, /exit quits.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u0001\u001b[1;32m\u0002>> \u0001\u001b[0m\u0002"]
[6.131498, "o", "the test for average() fails, fix it\r\r\n"]
[7.110749, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[35m▌ \u001b[0mI'll start by exploring the project to find the failing test.\r\r\n\u001b[2m- \u001b[0m\u001b[36mlist_files\u001b[0m\u001b[2m {}\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
