[11.419115, "o", "y\r\r\n"]
[12.850998, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[35m▌ \u001b[0mThe bug is in `stats.py` (dividing by `len+1`), not the test.\r\r\n\u001b[2m- \u001b[0m\u001b[36medit_file\u001b[0m\u001b[2m {\"path\": \"stats.py\", \"old_text\": \"    return sum(xs) / (len(\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[12.851492, "o", "\u001b[1;33m┌ permission needed: edit stats.py\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[31m--- a/stats.py\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[32m+++ b/stats.py\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[36m@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m def average(xs):\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[31m-    return sum(xs) / (len(xs) + 1)\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[32m+    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[12.851567, "o", "\u0001\u001b[1;33m\u0002└ allow? [y]es / [a]lways / [n]o / or type feedback › \u0001\u001b[0m\u0002"]
[15.101849, "o", "y\r\r\n"]
[15.96112, "o", "\u001b[2m- \u001b[0m\u001b[36mrun\u001b[0m\u001b[2m {\"command\": \"python3 -m unittest -v 2>&1 | tail -20\"}\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[1;33m┌ permission needed: run python3 -m unittest -v 2>&1 | tail -20\u001b[0m\r\r\n  python3 -m unittest -v 2>&1 | tail -20\r\r\n"]
[15.961178, "o", "\u0001\u001b[1;33m\u0002└ allow? [y]es / [a]lways / [n]o / or type feedback › \u0001\u001b[0m\u0002"]
[18.186349, "o", "y\r\r\n"]
[19.628457, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[35m▌ \u001b[0m**Fixed.** The bug was in the implementation, not the test: `stats.py:2` divided by `len(xs) + 1`, yielding 3.0 for `[2, 4, 6]` instead of 4.\r\r\n\u001b[35m▌ \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[35m▌ \u001b[0mChanged the divisor to `len(xs)`. Test suite now passes (1 test, OK).\r\r\n"]
